    "def": "for \\(h\\in\\{0,1,2\\}^3\\), \\(x\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\\), set \\(\\pi_h^{\\star}=3^{-3}\\) and \\(P^{\\star}(X_j=x\\mid H=h)=\\frac13+\\sum_{\\ell:\\Gamma^{\\star}_{j\\ell}=1}c^{\\star}_{j\\ell}(\\mathbf1\\{x=h_\\ell\\}-\\frac13)\\)",
